DESCRIPTION:Start your morning with a relaxing yoga class. This program w
 ill be recurring monthly throughout the fall semester.Event Details:    J
 oin Vibe Yoga at the IU Museum of Archaeology and Anthropology for a free
 -to-attend flow to connect with the community and find a space that feels
  grounded\, safe\, and gently energizing. This class is beginner friendly
  and welcomes all experience levels.      These classes are designed arou
 nd vinyasa\, seamlessly moving form pose into the next. Often referred to
  as a moving meditation\, vinyasa means to "place in a special way." The 
 practice helps us flow toward our most vibrant life.  Pre-registration is
  required at vibeyogastudio.com (http://vibeyogastudio.com)    Located at
  the IU Museum of Archaeology and Anthropology    Virgil T. Devault Progr
 ams Room (Room 111)    416 N Indiana Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47408      Th
 is class will occur monthly at 10am on:    Tuesday\, September 29    Tues
